	(text "You might be wondering why is there an external regulator? \n\nWell, the arduino 3V3 power output does not provide enough current\nto ensure LNA functionality, so we need to implement this Low dropout regulator\n\nThe coupling capacitors have been implemented following the LDO's datasheet"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 57.912 32.766 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "49022ec4-e6ba-4d6d-9dfe-e03ec0e13ee0")
	)
	(text "LDO 3V3 regulator"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 18.034 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "592c7b9f-4db8-4888-9177-73ba1d7c3f6f")
	)
	(text "nRF24 with PA+LNA module"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 189.738 36.068 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "757d1896-15fd-4dc4-8b3b-14709b38f9e7")
	)
	(text "LED indicators for radio status"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 188.976 103.124 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "85c0432b-e48a-45b2-94de-13b51ea096e2")
	)
	(text "It will be configured via software, comm status indicator will blink in case of \nactive transmission or on if radio link is establsihed.\n\nnRF24 detected will be on when the radio chip is detected by the arduino,\nto isolate problems related to the nRF24L01 breakout module"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 222.504 152.654 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a1767d6e-8d39-4bf9-b72c-87902560b172")
	)
	(text "Placed to be able to test \ncorrect supply to the module"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 263.398 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "bf005d82-3279-4f29-88fa-6f353a401683")
	)
	(text "Coupling capacitors to ensure proper \n3V3 supply for our chip"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.088 50.292 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "c8992a79-b8e8-4a24-87c2-7f1cc88638da")
	)
	(text "Arduino Nano 3.0 with USB-C connector\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 138.938 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "c995872f-9f08-40f9-8b3f-f77c0a7f6b8b")
	)
	(text "Used a external module because of the external \nPower Amplifier (PA) & Low Noise Amplifier (LNA),\nwhich suppresses the range problem suffered in FSA & FSS 2026\ndecreasing the minimum received transmission power to 95dBm\n\nFurther questions just ask me (Andrés)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.55 79.756 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d3a07346-b4c3-41d4-bf90-f5826c3a94e3")
	)
	(text "Upper signals are meant to be control signals for Radio Link\n& nRF24 chip status\n\n\nCE, CSN, MOSI, MISO & SCK are routed the same way as in a \nRF-NANO module to avoid coding mismatches"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.022 148.082 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d74693f2-f205-44f6-8429-ed4350a36b8d")
	)
